.claudeignore

# Agent instruction files. Delete a line here if you decide to share one with
# the team — they are ignored by default so a local experiment never lands in a
# release commit by accident.
CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.local.md
AGENTS.md
GEMINI.md
.github/instructions/
